DESCRIPTION:NAMI Family Support Group is a peer-led support group for any 
 adult with a loved one who has experienced symptoms of a mental health con
 dition. Gain insight from the challenges and successes of others facing si
 milar experiences. The NAMI Greater Bloomington Area (GBA) Family Support 
 Group meets on the first and third Mondays of the month from 5:45pm – 7:
 00pm and meets online.In February\, we will begin offering an in person Fa
 mily Support Group on the second Monday of each month from 5:45-7:00pm 
LOCATION:Zoom Meeting
URL:https://namigreaterbloomingtonarea.org/event/family-support-group-virt
 ual-25/2026-11-02/
X-SOURCE:NAMI Greater Bloomington
END:VEVENT
